<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:55:49 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>仅根据序列训练的 RNA 语言模型揭示了内部核糖体进入位点的结构逻辑</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/an-rna-language-model-trained-on-sequence-alone-reveals-the-structural-logic-of-internal-ribosome-entry-sites</link><description>每一种生物都依赖于称为核糖体的微小分子机器来构建蛋白质——我们细胞的主力。通常情况下，核糖体会附着在一条 RNA 链上，并开始像菜谱一样读取它。但一些病毒，包括小核糖核酸病毒（普通感冒和脊髓灰质炎病毒家族），已经进化出了一种巧妙的解决方法。他们没有使用标准的起始信号，而是使用称为内部核糖体进入位点（IRES）的特殊 RNA 结构来劫持我们的核糖体并迫使它们产生病毒蛋白。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:55:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/an-rna-language-model-trained-on-sequence-alone-reveals-the-structural-logic-of-internal-ribosome-entry-sites</guid></item><item><title>数百种自闭症突变集中在大脑中的两种分子模式上</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/hundreds-of-autism-mutations-converge-on-just-two-molecular-patterns-in-the-brain</link><description>研究人员分析了 17 个与自闭症相关的小鼠品系的基因表达，发现了两种相反的分子状态，这表明不同的风险突变可以&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/hundreds-of-autism-mutations-converge-on-just-two-molecular-patterns-in-the-brain.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:40:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/hundreds-of-autism-mutations-converge-on-just-two-molecular-patterns-in-the-brain</guid></item><item><title>尼古拉斯·羽毛球谈面对我们的未来：未来主义就是行动主义</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nikolas-badminton-on-facing-our-futures-futurism-is-activism</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nikolas-badminton-on-facing-our-futures-futurism-is-activism.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:25:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nikolas-badminton-on-facing-our-futures-futurism-is-activism</guid></item><item><title>“重生”恒星提供了实时观察恒星演化的难得机会</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/born-again-star-offers-rare-chance-to-watch-stellar-evolution-in-real-time</link><description>天文学家已经证实，有史以来观测到的变化最快的恒星之一已经进入了演化的新阶段，为观察恒星生命在人类时间尺度上的展开提供了难得的机会。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/born-again-star-offers-rare-chance-to-watch-stellar-evolution-in-real-time.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:10:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/born-again-star-offers-rare-chance-to-watch-stellar-evolution-in-real-time</guid></item><item><title>微型聚合物设备模仿神经元放电，指向节能边缘计算</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/tiny-polymer-devices-mimic-neuron-firing-pointing-toward-energy-efficient-edge-computing</link><description>麻省理工学院的研究人员创建了一个计算平台，可用于开发智能和自适应的下一代电子产品，这些电子产品可以在一个极其紧凑、节能的设备中执行多种功能，例如计算和存储。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/tiny-polymer-devices-mimic-neuron-firing-pointing-toward-energy-efficient-edge-computing2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:55:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/tiny-polymer-devices-mimic-neuron-firing-pointing-toward-energy-efficient-edge-computing</guid></item><item><title>新研究表明独特的物质状态产生于生物体</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/new-studies-suggest-unique-state-of-matter-gies-rise-to-living-organisms</link><description>惰性、被动的物质如何产生生命及其所有的作用和目的？化学家阿迪·普罗斯 (Addy Pross) 花了 25 年时间研究这个谜团，最终写成了一本具有里程碑意义的书《生命》(Life&amp;#39;s)。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/new-studies-suggest-unique-state-of-matter-gies-rise-to-living-organisms.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:40:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/new-studies-suggest-unique-state-of-matter-gies-rise-to-living-organisms</guid></item><item><title>科学家为先进核反应堆组件开发实时人工智能监控</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-develop-real-time-ai-monitoring-for-an-advanced-nuclear-reactor-component</link><description>正如厨房水槽堵塞会导致家庭日常生活中断一样，核反应堆热交换器的堵塞也会减慢运行速度并需要紧急关注。美国能源部 (DOE) 阿贡国家实验室的研究人员现在正在使用人工智能来及早发现这些隐藏的堵塞物。这种方法将有助于熔盐冷却反应堆（MSCR）平稳运行并减少昂贵的中断。该研究是&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-develop-real-time-ai-monitoring-for-an-advanced-nuclear-reactor-component.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:25:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-develop-real-time-ai-monitoring-for-an-advanced-nuclear-reactor-component</guid></item><item><title>激光驱动的自旋电子存储器件的切换速度比 DRAM 快 1,000 倍——非易失性器件在 40 皮秒内切换，同时几乎不产生热量</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/laser-driven-spintronic-memory-device-switches-1000-times-faster-than-dram-non-volatile-device-switches-in-40-picoseconds-while-generating-almost-no-heat</link><description>业界花了数十年的时间寻找一种“通用存储器”，它可以结合 SRAM 的速度、DRAM 的密度、闪存的持久性和低功耗。在超快的时间尺度上，这一挑战变得更加困难，其中许多实验性开关技术部分依赖于强力加热来快速破坏稳定和翻转状态。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/laser-driven-spintronic-memory-device-switches-1000-times-faster-than-dram-non-volatile-device-switches-in-40-picoseconds-while-generating-almost-no-heat2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:10:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/laser-driven-spintronic-memory-device-switches-1000-times-faster-than-dram-non-volatile-device-switches-in-40-picoseconds-while-generating-almost-no-heat</guid></item><item><title>研究表明，改良的艾滋病毒药物可以逆转多发性硬化症引起的视力丧失和瘫痪</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/modified-hiv-drug-could-reverse-vision-loss-paralysis-from-ms-study-suggests</link><description>一种实验药物逆转了患有多发性硬化症样症状的小鼠的视力丧失和瘫痪，促使研究人员探索其用于人类治疗的潜力。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/modified-hiv-drug-could-reverse-vision-loss-paralysis-from-ms-study-suggests.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 13:55:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/modified-hiv-drug-could-reverse-vision-loss-paralysis-from-ms-study-suggests</guid></item><item><title>抑癌基因</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/tumor-suppressor-genes</link><description>探索肿瘤抑制基因、它们在癌症预防中的作用、分子机制以及对诊断和治疗的影响。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/tumor-suppressor-genes.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 13:40:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/tumor-suppressor-genes</guid></item></channel></rss>